<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>SokoJamo Change Password</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;background-color:#f4f4f4;color:#222222;">
    <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;">
        <div style="background-color:#0070f3;padding:24px;color:#ffffff;">
            <h1 style="font-size:24px;margin:0;text-align:center;">Confirm Password Change</h1>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:24px;">
            <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
            <p>We received a request to change the password on your SokoJamo account. Use this code to confirm:</p>
            <h2 style="text-align:center;color:#0070f3;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:4px;margin:24px 0;"><%= otp %></h2>
            <p>This code expires in 5 minutes.</p>
            <p>If you did not request this, please secure your account and contact support.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color:#565656;padding:24px;">
            <p style="color:#ffffff;text-align:center;margin:0;">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SokoJamo. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>